              "text": "भुनाना (bhunānā) is listed by CDIAL under Sanskrit bhajyate, \"is broken\" (CDIAL 9361), with Hindi bhunnā, \"to be changed (of money)\", and its causative bhunānā: to break a big note into smaller money. CDIAL calls the u of these forms unexplained."
